WEBVTT

00:00:27.356 --> 00:00:30.068
which is basically
when conservation organizations

00:00:30.109 --> 00:00:33.071
claim to work for communities

00:00:33.071 --> 00:00:36.908
only to inform and impose
pre-designed conservation plans

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:38.493
instead of including them,

00:00:38.534 --> 00:00:41.037
misguiding media and funding sources.

00:00:41.079 --> 00:00:44.499
Think of greenwashing,
and then apply it to conservation.

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:48.628
Hopefully we can all agree
that approach is not right,

00:00:48.628 --> 00:00:50.421
and it needs to be tackled.

00:00:50.963 --> 00:00:52.465
And how about we start

00:00:52.465 --> 00:00:57.470
by twisting classic community-based
conservation questions upside down?

00:00:57.804 --> 00:01:00.973
Say, instead of wondering
how to bring science